		{
			dependencies: ["73F7C99EE4ABCE4F"]
			description: [
				"&eCoal is a carbon-rich sedimentary fuel formed from buried organic matter over geological time. It is a mixture, rather than a single mineral.&r"
				""
				"&eSmall coal deposits occur at Y -63 to 160. Coal supplies furnace fuel, coke manufacture and carbon-based chemistry; biological conversion of peat provides another source.&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			id: "0506C2A234B9703F"
			tasks: [{
