		{
			dependencies: ["73F7C99EE4ABCE4F"]
			description: [
				"&eNatural lapis lazuli is a blue rock containing lazurite, often with calcite and flecks of pyrite. Powdered lapis was historically the source of ultramarine pigment.&r"
				""
				"&eLapis ore here spans Y -63 to 160. The blue mineral is used for dye, and its powder supports Crystallum Coccus crystal reconstruction.&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
