			dependencies: ["73F7C99EE4ABCE4F"]
			description: [
				"&eZinc ore is distributed from Y -63 to 160. Sphalerite is another zinc source, recognizable as a distinct compound mineral.&r"
				""
				"&eHere, zinc supplies brass and acts as a returned catalyst in polyethylene and PVC production. In real industry, zinc coatings protect steel by corroding in its place.&r"
			]
