			description: [
				"&eSmall lead deposits occur between Y -63 and 160. Raw lead powder is smeltable, while galena supplies lead together with traces of zinc and silver.&r"
				""
				"&eLead is dense, soft and toxic. Its real-world uses include radiation shielding and lead-acid batteries.&r"
			]
