		{
			dependencies: ["73F7C99EE4ABCE4F"]
			description: [
				"&eLithium is the lightest metal, but natural lithium is found in compounds rather than free metallic lumps. Real commercial sources include mineral deposits and salt-rich brines.&r"
				""
				"&eThe local ore deposits span Y -63 to 160 and supply raw lithium. Magnesite separation and microbial treatment of rhyolite provide additional lithium-bearing outputs.&r"
			]
