		{
			dependencies: ["009C96B36DFFDD5B"]
			description: [
				"&eGold can occur as native metal, in veins and in mineral compounds. Its resistance to oxidation helps metallic grains survive weathering.&r"
				""
				"&eOverworld gold ores yield raw gold; Nether gold ore normally yields nuggets. Petzite is a gold-bearing mineral whose separation also recovers silver.&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
