			dependencies: ["450EC9FCCFB49FA9"]
			description: [
				"&eChalcocite is copper sulfide, Cu2S, a dark mineral with a high copper content. It can become concentrated in zones enriched by groundwater moving through copper deposits.&r"
				""
				"&eBands begin at Y 0-70 in ordinary Overworld geology. Separation and acid leaching recover copper with molybdenum and gold byproducts. Vibration and centrifugation also recover sulfur.&r"
