		{
			dependencies: ["450EC9FCCFB49FA9"]
			description: [
				"&eHematite is iron oxide, Fe2O3. Even a dark metallic specimen leaves a reddish-brown streak, a useful real-world identification feature.&r"
				""
				"&eOrdinary bands span Y -63 to 70; Sandy Caves carry a slightly more frequent type from Y -63 to 63. The mineral supplies iron by physical separation.&r"
