		{
			dependencies: ["450EC9FCCFB49FA9"]
			description: [
				"&eAmethyst is the violet variety of quartz. In real specimens, trace iron and irradiation contribute to its color.&r"
				""
				"&eAmethyst geodes occur in Molten Caves. Their solid amethyst lining is distinct from budding amethyst, the base that grows crystal clusters and produces shards.&r"
