		{
			dependencies: ["450EC9FCCFB49FA9"]
			description: [
				"&ePetzite is a silver-gold telluride, Ag3AuTe2. Natural petzite belongs to the telluride minerals associated with some gold deposits.&r"
				""
				"&eLocal bands begin at Y -63 to -30 and are scarce. Physical separation supplies gold and a silver byproduct.&r"
